/LIST FOR STATIC IOT TEST. EACH ENTRY CONSISTS OF
/IOT-CODE, SHOULD-SKIP, MAY-CHANGE-AC, (SHOULD-CLEAR-AC).
/THE LAST ELEMENT IS ONLY NEEDED IF MAY-CHANGE-AC IS YES.
IOTLST,	6200;N;N
	CMME;N;N
	RTM;N;Y;N
	SKME;N;N
	SKMM;Y;N
	LTM;N;Y;Y
	LRM;N;Y;Y
